  <data key="d35">0.9</data>
  <data key="d36">A rapid rise in conventional strikes produces immediate uncertainty about supply disruptions, casualty and infrastructure risk and counter‑measures, triggering quick portfolio rebalancing and larger intra‑day price moves across bonds, equities and FX.</data>
