<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::alliance_cohesion" target="energy_asset_realloc::sanction_enforcement_lev" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher operational coordination among allied governments enables harmonized legal measures, intelligence-sharing and joint compliance actions that raise the intensity and reach of sanction implementation.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">energy_asset_realloc</data>
</edge>
<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::alliance_cohesion" target="global_bond_repricing::yield_curve_level" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Strengthened allied coordination and credible burden‑sharing commitments reduce sovereign risk premia for front‑line and support countries, lowering sovereign yields across the curve as investors require less compensation for political tail risk.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">global_bond_repricing</data>
</edge>
<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::alliance_cohesion" target="us_china_tech_trade::ai_investment_flow" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Improved operational and political coordination among Western allies leads to pooled procurement, coordinated R&amp;D programs and subsidy packages aimed at sustaining an edge in AI, channeling additional public and private capital into allied AI startups, infrastructure and defense‑oriented AI R&amp;D.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_trade</data>
</edge>
<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::alliance_cohesion" target="us_iran_confront::sanctions_intensity" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Greater US–European operational and political cohesion around the Ukraine response facilitates coordinated legal design and political backing for broader, multilateral and secondary sanctions programs that can be applied against Iran.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">us_iran_confront</data>
</edge>
