  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Stricter export controls and compliance rules around AI/related tech force correspondent banks and clearing providers to cut or restrict relationships with counterparties exposed to sanctioned Iranian tech transfers, immediately reducing Iran's access to global clearing.</data>
