  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Sustained capital outflows erode trade finance and working‑capital lines for exporters and their buyers (independent of formal clearing relationships), causing shipment delays and reduced crude export volumes.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_bond_repricing</data>
