  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Expansion of long‑term access agreements embeds foreign firms and states in local energy infrastructure and revenue streams, giving those external actors sustained economic leverage and political influence in the region.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">energy_asset_realloc</data>
